# UI (shadcn + Tailwind)

- shadcn primitives live in `components/ui/` only; add via `pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add <component>`.
- App-specific composition lives in `components/`. Use `cn()` from `lib/utils.ts`.
- Neutral design tokens live in `app/globals.css`. Prefer semantic tokens over hardcoded colors; keep feature styles out of `globals.css`.
- Data views handle loading, empty, error, and success states.
